WEBVTT

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.330
You want to start your own brand?

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:22.540
Then prove yourself to me.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.620
Fifty-two inquiries.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.870
When I participated in the Geika Festival,

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:31.580
while a student,

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:34.700
I received 52 inquiries from buyers.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:40.120
That record has stood for the past 40 years.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:44.040
If that's what Grandmother really thinks...

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:47.330
If you can break that record,

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:49.160
do what you want.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.330
"Smile Down the Runway"

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:27.580
"Episode 12: This Is My Story"

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:33.200
Is it just me or do those clothes look strange?

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:34.870
So cool!

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:38.080
Ah... What? How so?

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:40.950
Ichika, do you think it's cool?

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:43.040
It looks powerful!

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:47.370
It's like a robot!

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:49.330
I definitely didn't see it like that.

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:51.870
Yeah... I don't get it at all.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.120
Oh?

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:58.120
There seems to be more people now.

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:02.620
Perhaps... it's because Toh Ayano's up next.

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:04.120
I see...

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:06.040
What? Who are you?

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:07.540
Hi there!

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.330
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.580
"Satomi Ichihara"

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:16.750
Miss Satomi Ichihara...

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.830
Wait, what? You're a b-buyer...?!

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:23.120
Oh, it's just a privately run select shop.

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:25.080
Wow...

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:30.450
At least half of the people who
just arrived are most likely buyers.

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:34.160
There's a lot of hype around
Mr. Toh Ayano, you know?

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:38.410
These people... They're all...

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:42.870
Huh?

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:48.080
Oh, but anyway! Mr. Tsumura.
Would you like to sell me a few of your designs?

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.000
What?

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.660
Your show really caught my attention.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:53.950
Let's settle the details another day.

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:55.620
Do you have a card on you?

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:58.500
Oh, no, I don't!

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.870
You should have some ready!

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:03.500
You never know when these things happen.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:04.830
All right then.

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:06.160
--Don't forget to contact me!

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:08.450
--Please wait... Oh...
--Don't forget to contact me!

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:12.540
Did I just...

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:14.660
...sell some of my clothes...?

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:24.250
We are mere slaves to designs.

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:31.500
We use our eyes to see the colors,
our skin to feel the quality...

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:35.830
Our memory to store techniques,
to give it our heart.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:41.870
The very clothes we produce by
dedicating our body and soul, are us.

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:46.040
Everyone, open your eyes.

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:52.540
Now, let's go.

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:58.250
Wow!

00:04:58.250 --> 00:04:59.370
What?

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:03.410
A plain T-shirt?

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:06.040
A T-shirt with the logo of the brand.

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:09.870
A huge money-maker if it's
a hit among young people.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.830
It's geared towards the buyers.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.830
The theme is harmony.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.750
The same as mine.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:20.410
But he started off featuring a universal style.

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:24.580
A hit or a miss, it all depends
on the designs that follow.

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:28.910
It's an unbelievably risky arrangement.

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:31.330
But the expectation we have for Toh Ayano

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:34.700
only intensifies the anticipation
for the next outfit.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:38.160
--Ah! Two designs at once!
--Wow...!

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:42.000
An everyday design juxtaposed
with an eccentric design!

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:45.700
Harmony between the ordinary and unordinary!

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:48.580
So this is Toh's theme.

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:50.120
Wow...

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:59.080
A brilliant haute couture line
that showcases his abilities,

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:03.620
and a ready-to-wear line that lends itself
to everyday wear and mass production.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:05.830
There's harmony between them.

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:09.250
He'd be an instant asset, I gotta say.

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:14.160
Three years ago, I received eight.
Two years ago, I received 22.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:18.540
Last year I received 31. I wasn't even close.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:21.620
I wasn't even close... Not at all...

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:24.450
It's been an unattainable goal.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:27.040
And this year is my final chance.

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:56.450
Wow...

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:05.370
Superior design skills...

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:23.040
Wow...

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:31.950
He's got tremendous technique...

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:37.250
Wow...!

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.950
The results will be in momentarily.

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:02.200
--Participants, please gather in the back.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:04.290
--Oh, I have to go.
--Participants, please gather in the back.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:05.450
Ikuto.

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:06.790
Huh?

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:08.250
Ikuto...

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:11.040
You did an amazing job.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:12.540
Yes.

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:14.250
Thank you.

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:18.580
How adorable! This year's
Geika Festival was just adorable!

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:21.450
There were so many clothes I wanted to wear!

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:24.950
Yeah, that was impressive.
Who are you voting for?

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:26.910
That's a secret.

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:30.790
Hey, maybe I should give him my card.

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:33.080
"Say, want to come work for us?"

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.290
Are you serious?

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:35.750
I'm only kidding.

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:39.200
No way. Ms. Mai is scary.

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:42.540
So, what should I do?

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:50.160
I'm going to pass.

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:58.950
What? That tiny model was the same one
from the Hazime Yanagida show?

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:00.700
Yes, that's her.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:02.910
She may be a short person,

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:06.910
but as a model, she has so much presence.

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:09.910
Don't you think she has a powerful aura?

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:13.120
Hey, you're hyping her up quite a bit.

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:15.950
MODE JAPAN is strict about their models, but...

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:16.870
Huh?

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:21.000
Are you going to Paris if you get first place?

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:27.200
Do you think I even have a chance?
Did you see Mr. Ayano's show...?

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:28.910
There's no way...

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:31.580
What? Then are you giving up
becoming a designer?

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:33.830
That's why I'm concerned!

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:37.660
Oh... I hope Ms. Igarashi will forgive me...

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.500
Huh? Are you serious?

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:44.620
You looking down at me like that is really
pissing me off right now. Crouch down, darn it!

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:48.040
Listen to me!

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:50.620
Don't move!

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:53.370
--Hey.
--Ah...

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:54.870
What...?

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:59.700
Um... Thank you so much
for coming to see my show!

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.620
You're also wearing my suit...

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:06.750
There's nothing to talk about now.
Come to me when you get your results.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:16.370
Oh? Hey, high schooler!

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:19.620
Oh... Mr. Ryunosuke.

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:23.120
Hey, so what are you planning
to do after high school?

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:24.370
What?

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:27.000
I don't know about your financial situation,

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.950
but I'm sure you'd be able
to get a scholarship, easy.

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:33.000
Come to Geika, so I can crush you.

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:36.580
Since when were you guys friends?

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:37.950
Oh...

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:40.410
Miss Kizaki.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.870
Hey, what did you think of my designs?

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.950
What? Oh, um...

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:46.910
They were really wonderful.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.160
Okay.

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:53.160
Thanks.

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:55.540
What? You're friends with him, too?

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:56.700
Shut up.

00:10:56.700 --> 00:11:00.250
We will now announce the results.

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:04.080
Participants, please gather at the staging area.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.370
Let's go.

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:07.830
Yes!

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:11.660
How did you do?

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:14.950
Toh, did you get 53 inquiries?

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:19.200
I don't know, I haven't counted yet.
Do you want to count?

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:23.910
How silly. Limiting yourself like this.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:26.160
You should live more freely.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:36.410
It's time to announce the results!

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:37.750
Huh?

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:41.870
Hey... Is this mic okay...?

00:11:41.870 --> 00:11:44.370
It's time to announce the results!

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:51.620
Thanks to everyone, this year's
Geika Festival was a success!

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:56.950
Those who ranked #1-10 will be
called up to the runway.

00:11:56.950 --> 00:11:59.790
Those who ranked #11 and below will stay here.

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:05.540
Those who are called, proceed to the stage with
your model to receive your critique and trophy.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:08.620
I'd like to take this moment to say this...

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:12.200
The ranking does not reflect
the quality of the clothes.

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:14.370
But since this is a contest,

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:22.580
we judged them by originality,
construction, and presentation.

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:28.450
And this is only an evaluation from an artistic
perspective we've been cultivating.

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:34.040
It's not meant to reject what you thought
as wonderful and amazing.

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:39.870
Please enjoy what you felt was #1,
what you felt was fashionable.

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:43.450
Now, let's move forward with the ceremony.

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:45.870
There's someone I want to beat.

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:48.410
There's someone I don't want to lose to.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:51.080
There's someone I want approval from.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.790
Our first-place winner is...!

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:06.330
Our first-place winner is...!

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:13.410
Kokoro Hasegawa!

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:14.910
Ah!

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:16.750
All right!

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:17.910
Take that!

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:19.410
Oh...

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:23.830
Hey, don't look that stunned. Let's go.

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:39.790
Congratulations!

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:41.950
You did great!

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:44.410
She's... the first-place winner?

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:46.830
It was great, but...

00:13:56.450 --> 00:14:03.410
Your theme of "waku waku" was well-suited
for the Geika Festival and excited everyone.

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:06.200
You are the first-place winner.

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:10.540
Hey, Kokoro! It's been a while.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:12.200
Miss Sara...

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:16.330
Congratulations. Good luck from here on out!

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:18.370
As a designer...

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:21.660
Wow...!

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:29.540
Now I'll be announcing the rest of the results.

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:31.080
Second place...

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:50.120
Seventh place, Kaoru Kizaki.

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:51.910
Ah. Darn it.

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.000
Ah...

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:54.410
Oh...

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.290
That was the top ten.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.750
The names I just called will go on stage.

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:03.540
I'll be announcing the rest of the results
and providing the critique here.

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:06.910
Eleventh place, Ikuto Tsumura.

00:15:06.910 --> 00:15:10.250
Huh? Ikuto Tsumura?

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:11.620
Yes...

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.950
"The construction was precise and neat.

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:21.660
The world-themed designs and
arrangements were incredible.

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:24.790
But the designs were solely based
on the different countries,

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:27.870
lacking creativity and uniqueness."

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:34.950
"Practical clothes... Your designs were too much
like the ordinary clothes we wear every day.

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:39.410
Designers have the duty to discover new fashion.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:43.000
We suggest you focus on that from here on out."

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:44.200
Yes...

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:50.290
This was only your first show.
There's no need to be that depressed.

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:09.160
Toh Ayano, you're in last place because
you withdrew. Are you satisfied?

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:12.870
Yes. I have no problem with that at all.

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:25.250
There he is. Yusuke, get him.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:26.290
Yeah.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:28.370
Ah... What?!

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:36.370
Ikuto's not here.

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:41.040
Since he wasn't on stage,
he didn't make top ten...

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:45.200
Do you think his clothes were that bad...?

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:49.660
That can't be. It probably just didn't
mesh well for this event.

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:51.700
He's got talent.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:17:00.120
"Manager Igarashi
Congratulations.
Come back anytime."

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:06.540
Hey, wait a minute. What's up
with this happy-ending scenario?

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:11.120
Where's my apology?!
She better apologize to me!

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:12.410
Chiyuki Fujito.

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:14.500
I'm gonna get my apology, no matter what!

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:16.950
Chiyuki Fujito, can you hear me?

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:19.870
Huh? Whoa! Who are you, lady?

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:21.830
Chiyuki! This lady's...

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:25.160
I'd like to speak to you.

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:26.370
What...?

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:32.830
That's...

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:35.950
Mr. Toh's lovely eleventh outfit.

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:39.450
And the outfit that stumped
all of us patternmakers.

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:40.830
Oh...

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:43.330
I'm going to change into this, so turn around.

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.500
What? Okay...

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.370
Hm...

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:58.290
Okay, I'm ready. It's not my size,
so it looks a little off...

00:17:58.290 --> 00:17:59.500
The sleeves...

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:00.370
Ah...!

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:03.200
It doesn't puff up enough.

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:05.790
I knew it...

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:08.870
May I take a look?

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:12.540
The shoulder dart doesn't seem right.

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:16.250
If you made it 10mm, no, 5mm wider...

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:19.540
If you were on our team,
Mr. Toh would've achieved his vision!

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:20.830
Huh...?

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:24.750
Nobody was able to keep up
with Mr. Toh's standards.

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:27.160
That's why he ended up fixing every outfit...

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:30.910
And he ran out of time to fix this one.

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:34.830
Mr. Toh's goal was to receive 53
inquiries from the buyers.

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:38.330
But he only got... 52.

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:40.870
If only this outfit were finished...!

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:43.790
That's why he withdrew...

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:47.790
If only you were on board as a patternmaker!

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:57.870
"Ballot Sara
1) Kokoro Hasegawa"
Everyone besides Sara voted for Toh.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:19:00.950
"Ballot Kamii      "Ballot Suo
1) Toh Ayano"     1) Toh Ayano"
The participants who received
inquiries from buyers today were...

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:04.160
...just Toh and Ikuto.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:08.250
I'm so glad we allowed non-student participants.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:14.040
Toh has worked alone for a very long time...

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:16.910
I think he finally found a friend.

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:21.660
I'm sure Ikuto will follow his lead...

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:26.410
"Geika Fashion School
Student Application
Admission Test
Scholarship Information"

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:33.370
Just because you didn't surpass me,

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:36.120
that doesn't mean it's the end.

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:37.660
What are you going to do now?

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:41.620
I'll be working for you for a while longer.

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:44.160
As long as you're an asset,
you're more than welcome.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:49.500
But your show today...
You're still imitating my designs.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.160
I couldn't see any growth.

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:52.120
So why don't you--

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.080
I'm not starting my own brand.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:54.910
What?

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:59.540
I won't be able to appreciate myself like that.

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:04.910
I don't break promises.
I'm a bit of a narcissist, you know?

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:13.790
Ah... I'm going to cry...

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:19.160
Go, first-born son! Win, first-born son!

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:24.000
Ah... My mind keeps wandering off...

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:26.330
What am I going to do now...?

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:27.330
Huh?

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:32.950
"Mr. Hajime Yanagida"
"Work next Saturday.
Be there."

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:36.580
Oh, Ikuto!

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:37.660
Ah!

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:41.830
There you are.

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:44.250
Here, I wanted to give you this.

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:45.080
Huh?

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:48.330
It's Geika's student application form.

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:51.910
You can always enroll at Geika
and work as an intern.

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:53.410
An intern?

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:56.870
You'll be able to work while going to school.

00:20:56.870 --> 00:21:00.080
You're only a 17-year-old high school student.

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:03.750
You faced older college students today.

00:21:03.750 --> 00:21:06.870
Today's achievement will
benefit you no matter what.

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:10.330
You'll improve even more.

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:16.160
Geika will welcome a student like you anytime!

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:17.750
Thank you very much.

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:19.700
I'll see you later, Ikuto.

00:21:21.330 --> 00:21:22.700
All right.

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:24.870
Don't slouch!

00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:26.540
Whoa!

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:28.160
What? Oh...

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:28.950
Hey.

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:32.080
O-Oh... Congratulations.

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:34.540
Not you, too...

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:36.660
Show me your pain!

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:37.700
What?!

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:40.540
Kokoro just keeps crying...

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:43.160
And Igarashi just left...!

00:21:43.160 --> 00:21:45.950
So Ikuto! Tell me that you're bitter!

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:49.540
That's why I'm telling you, "Congratulations"...

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:52.250
Are you serious? You're not bitter at all?

00:21:52.250 --> 00:21:55.080
Not at all. It's all very great.

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.910
Well, wait until you hear this!

00:21:57.910 --> 00:21:59.250
Huh?

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:03.450
I'm going to be an exclusive model
for a magazine.

00:22:03.450 --> 00:22:06.040
I'm starting up a new magazine.

00:22:06.040 --> 00:22:10.410
It's a teen's fashion magazine geared towards
high school girls with a more mature style.

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:12.660
You're going to be our model.

00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:14.870
An exclusive model.

00:22:14.870 --> 00:22:17.000
How about that?

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:19.790
Now I'm bitter.

00:22:19.790 --> 00:22:21.620
I'm really bitter!

00:22:21.620 --> 00:22:26.700
You better be. Because I feel
so good beating you, Ikuto!

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:28.000
I don't know...

00:22:28.000 --> 00:22:30.540
This was my first time...

00:22:30.540 --> 00:22:32.870
Feeling defeated...

00:22:32.870 --> 00:22:35.500
I never want to lose to anyone again!

00:22:44.200 --> 00:22:48.120
Hey Ikuto, you better hurry
and catch up with me.

00:22:48.120 --> 00:22:49.750
I know.

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:53.620
Or else, I might go to Paris
Fashion Week without you.

00:22:53.620 --> 00:22:54.790
Yes!

00:22:59.910 --> 00:23:02.830
"Was I rated higher than my actual ability?
I'm unmotivated.
What should I do about starting my own brand?
I don't want to go to Paris."

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:05.620
"Was I rated higher than my actual ability?"

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:06.620
"I'm unmotivated."

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:07.620
"What should I do about starting my own brand?"

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:08.910
"I don't want to go to Paris."

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:15.080
I don't want to be left behind.

00:23:17.790 --> 00:23:21.200
I can still take on new challenges.

00:23:21.200 --> 00:23:28.330
I'm Chiyuki Fujito. This is my story
of becoming a top model.

00:23:28.330 --> 00:23:29.660
And...

00:23:31.250 --> 00:23:34.370
I'll be closing Hazime Yanagida for a while.

00:23:34.370 --> 00:23:37.250
What? But why?

00:23:37.250 --> 00:23:41.290
Aphro I Dite invited me on board as a designer.

00:23:41.290 --> 00:23:45.830
Aphro I Dite... That's Mr. Ayano's
grandmother's brand!

00:23:45.830 --> 00:23:51.660
If I show results with Japan's premier
fashion brand, it'll increase my worth.

00:23:51.660 --> 00:23:54.750
So I can eventually get to Paris Fashion Week.

00:23:54.750 --> 00:23:56.750
What are your plans?

00:23:56.750 --> 00:23:57.700
Oh...

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:04.330
I want to move forward...

00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:07.950
Hello? What is it?

00:24:07.950 --> 00:24:11.830
Will I be able to work at Aphro I Dite, too?

00:24:14.290 --> 00:24:18.370
And I'm Ikuto Tsumura.

00:24:18.370 --> 00:24:20.540
So we meet again.

00:24:21.330 --> 00:24:22.580
Yes!

00:24:22.580 --> 00:24:24.410
I'm looking forward to working with you!

00:24:25.500 --> 00:24:29.620
This is my story of becoming the top designer.

00:24:31.120 --> 00:24:33.950
<i>Smile Down the Runway.</i>

00:24:33.950 --> 00:24:36.910
"Thank you very much!!"
